msgid ""
"Journal for the entry that moves a down payment from the\n"
"                            customer it was invoiced to onto the customer of the\n"
"                            final invoice."
msgstr ""
"Diario del asiento que traspasa un anticipo del cliente al que se facturó al"
" cliente de la factura final."

#. module: pms_downpayment_lifecycle
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_downpayment_lifecycle.field_res_company__downpayment_transfer_journal_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_downpayment_lifecycle.field_res_config_settings__downpayment_transfer_journal_id
msgid ""
"Journal used for the entry that moves a down payment balance from the "
"customer it was invoiced to onto the customer of the final invoice. Falls "
"back to the first miscellaneous journal of the company."
msgstr ""
"Diario del asiento que traspasa el saldo de un anticipo del cliente al que "
"se facturó al cliente de la factura final. Si se deja vacío, se usa el "
"primer diario de operaciones varias de la compañía."

